ADDITIONAL TERMS FOR THE PAYLOAD DATA IN THIS REPOSITORY

The MIT license above covers the software. It also covers the payload
vocabulary in `src/polyglot_bug_hunter/payloads.py` and `hf_model/payload_vocabulary.json`.

Every payload in that vocabulary is non-destructive by construction and is
verified as such by `safety.is_forbidden_payload()`. They exist to help
defenders test systems they own or have written permission to test.

Using these payloads against any system you do not own or have written
permission to test may violate computer-fraud and computer-misuse law in your
jurisdiction. That is on you, not on the authors.
